{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf4a Welcome to Orange Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You spawn into the world as... well, an orange. No explanation, no backstory \u2014 just you, your bouncy peel, and a strange ramp calling your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb it, and whatever you do \u2014 <strong>don\u2019t stop at the top</strong>. A super sprint will launch you forward at insane speed. The laws of physics? Optional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also have a special ability: the <strong>Mega Jump</strong>. Press <strong>SPACEBAR</strong> to jump... and keep pressing. Each jump boosts your strength, letting you leap higher and higher like a juicy superhero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your first mission and earn the ultimate reward: <strong>a car</strong>.<br>It\u2019s got first-person and third-person modes, a fuel system (don\u2019t run out!), and full orange-powered movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and since you gathered all those oranges... you can now <strong>throw infinite oranges</strong>. For fun. Or chaos. Your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude82 Jump like a maniac.<br>\ud83d\udca6 Avoid water (you can\u2019t swim \u2014 you\u2019re an orange, remember?).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No deep narrative. No complex systems. Just pure, ridiculous fun in a surreal open world.<br>Welcome to <strong>Orange Life</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3842430?t=1766690312","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842430/6b5d4d25c633f7b060e911408e0e50a12e0d390d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766690312","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842430/22489f4dff378c86544c9d8821076cc26f7cca8d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766690312","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842430/22489f4dff378c86544c9d8821076cc26f7cca8d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766690312","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game contains partial nudity with low-poly character models. Some characters may appear unclothed, but there is no sexual content or explicit depiction of genitalia."},"demos":[{"appid":3845320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf4a Welcome to Orange Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You spawn into the world as... well, an orange. No explanation, no backstory \u2014 just you, your bouncy peel, and a strange ramp calling your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb it, and whatever you do \u2014 <strong>don\u2019t stop at the top</strong>. A super sprint will launch you forward at insane speed. The laws of physics? Optional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also have a special ability: the <strong>Mega Jump</strong>. Press <strong>SPACEBAR</strong> to jump... and keep pressing. Each jump boosts your strength, letting you leap higher and higher like a juicy superhero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your first mission and earn the ultimate reward: <strong>a car</strong>.<br>It\u2019s got first-person and third-person modes, a fuel system (don\u2019t run out!), and full orange-powered movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and since you gathered all those oranges... you can now <strong>throw infinite oranges</strong>. For fun. Or chaos. Your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude82 Jump like a maniac.<br>\ud83d\udca6 Avoid water (you can\u2019t swim \u2014 you\u2019re an orange, remember?).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No deep narrative. No complex systems. Just pure, ridiculous fun in a surreal open world.<br>Welcome to <strong>Orange Life</strong></p>","developers":["Bonea Ionut Daniel"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite